  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SME Boost: Economic Integration of Internally Displaced People and Business Recovery (via IOM to Mitigate the COVID-19 Crisis)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall project objective is to contribute to economic adaptation, recovery and growth in Ukraine in the aftermath of the COVID-19 pandemic, through targeted support to affected MSMEs primarily for job retention and creation. The project activities will complement Government of Ukraine&#x2019;s emergency actions and support a robust and targeted response to long-term implications of COVID-19 in Ukraine. The project will also directly contribute to stabilization efforts in Ukraine through improved conditions for the sustainable socio-economic inclusion of internally displaced persons, victims of trafficking and domestic violence, and returnees, through revitalization of local economies.</narrative>
  </description>
